{"id":"925d2af8413c094e1de6183f8512a729cb808dc6","url":"https://www.v2ex.com/t/1233897","title":"为什么 Claude 的 pro 套餐这么耐用两天烧了 12 亿 tokens，都没碰到一次 5 小时限额","site_name":"Info Flow","source":"V2EX (创意工作者社区)","byline":"Tom87","excerpt":"Claude - @Tom87 - ![pasted_1786526117198_5xv2m8.png]( https://pic.imgdd.cc/i/0345mppd43xgGxsuh62x79.png)","content_html":"<DIV class=\"page\" id=\"readability-page-1\"><div id=\"Main\">\n                \n                \n<div><p><img alt=\"pasted_1786526117198_5xv2m8.png\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" rel=\"noreferrer\" src=\"https://pic.imgdd.cc/i/0345mppd43xgGxsuh62x79.png\"></p></div>\n\n<!-- SOL tip topic -->\n\n\n\n\n\n<div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17967405\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/3baa/a944/800854_normal.png?m=1779784301\" alt=\"lel020\" data-uid=\"800854\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>3</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/lel020\">lel020</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-08-12 17:49:59 +08:00\">22h 42m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>缓存命中 99%这么耐用的吗，平时用什么模型和思考？<br>我也想订一个 claude 试试了，codex 这边大环境越来越不行了，</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17967548\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/f83f84940b369d0bb692bd00169bd69d?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"Tom87\" data-uid=\"566306\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>6</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/Tom87\">Tom87</a></strong> &#160; <div><p>OP</p></div>&#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-08-12 18:29:40 +08:00\">22h 2m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>@<a href=\"/member/lel020\">lel020</a> claude-sonnet-5 ，思考应该是自动的</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17968065\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/b391/300f/315881_normal.png?m=1780906428\" alt=\"mMartin\" data-uid=\"315881\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>8</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/mMartin\">mMartin</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-08-12 22:55:39 +08:00\">17h 36m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>你 bug 了 等着被封号吧</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17968819\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/82fcbc4c716cc289d59eed05b7f98336?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"scegg\" data-uid=\"128796\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>10</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/scegg\">scegg</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-08-13 09:52:10 +08:00\">6h 40m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>一个人用这样很正常。一个工程的 cache 率常年 95%+，加上很多本地任务（比如单元测试）都严重影响了 AI 消耗速度。<br>容易撞到 5x 通常是：<br>（ 1 ）同时推进几个工程。<br>（ 2 ）并发了很多 agent 。<br>（ 3 ）几个人一起用。</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17969235\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/70bf/c4b7/90904_normal.png?m=1784015141\" alt=\"LovingYoung\" data-uid=\"90904\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>11</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/LovingYoung\">LovingYoung</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-08-13 10:52:18 +08:00\">5h 39m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>sonnet 和 opus 感觉计费不是 api 的对应关系，只用 opus 单窗口也差不多 5h (usage 25$)勉强够用，只用 sonnet 我体感额度很慷慨</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17970319\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/f83f84940b369d0bb692bd00169bd69d?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"Tom87\" data-uid=\"566306\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>13</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/Tom87\">Tom87</a></strong> &#160; <div><p>OP</p></div>&#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-08-13 14:36:56 +08:00\">1h 55m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>@<a href=\"/member/scegg\">scegg</a> 一直都是一个人用的，cache 率一般都在 99%以上</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17970857\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/d966/10f7/555726_normal.png?m=1786607177\" alt=\"viiber\" data-uid=\"555726\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>14</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/viiber\">viiber</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-08-13 15:49:44 +08:00\">42 mins ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>我也有同感。最近两周这几天突然很耐用，之前一下用完。使用的还是 opus 5.0 ultracode 不清楚什么原理。</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n    \n    \n\n\n</div>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n            </div></DIV>","content_text":"3 lel020 22h 42m ago 缓存命中 99%这么耐用的吗，平时用什么模型和思考？我也想订一个 claude 试试了，codex 这边大环境越来越不行了， 6 Tom87 OP 22h 2m ago @lel020 claude-sonnet-5 ，思考应该是自动的 8 mMartin 17h 36m ago 你 bug 了 等着被封号吧 10 scegg 6h 40m ago 一个人用这样很正常。一个工程的 cache 率常年 95%+，加上很多本地任务（比如单元测试）都严重影响了 AI 消耗速度。容易撞到 5x 通常是：（ 1 ）同时推进几个工程。（ 2 ）并发了很多 agent 。（ 3 ）几个人一起用。 11 LovingYoung 5h 39m ago sonnet 和 opus 感觉计费不是 api 的对应关系，只用 opus 单窗口也差不多 5h (usage 25$)勉强够用，只用 sonnet 我体感额度很慷慨 13 Tom87 OP 1h 55m ago @scegg 一直都是一个人用的，cache 率一般都在 99%以上 14 viiber 42 mins ago 我也有同感。最近两周这几天突然很耐用，之前一下用完。使用的还是 opus 5.0 ultracode 不清楚什么原理。","fetched_at":"2026-08-13T08:35:04.956Z","ok":true}